{
  "headline": "Shiba Inu Risks Losing Top 30 Spot as Shytoshi Kusama Remains Absent",
  "summary": "Shiba Inu (SHIB) is teetering on the edge of losing its top 30 cryptocurrency ranking by market capitalization as the token faces mounting price pressure and lead developer Shytoshi Kusama's extended absence from social media raises community concerns about the project's direction.",
  "category": "shiba-inu-coin",
  "primary_topic": "SHIB market position threatened amid developer absence and price decline",
  "word_count": 0,
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "SHIB currently ranks as the 29th-largest cryptocurrency by market cap, at risk of slipping out of the top 30",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "SHIB trades at $0.000004677 with a market cap of $2.75 billion at press time",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "PYUSD ($2.74 billion market cap) and AVAX ($2.72 billion market cap) are closely trailing SHIB in rankings",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "SHIB has declined 32.3% since the start of 2026",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "SHIB remains 94.73% below its all-time high of $0.00008845",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Lead developer Shytoshi Kusama has been inactive on X (formerly Twitter) for more than 5 weeks, since May 13, 2026",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Kusama's last post on May 13 tagged fellow developer Kaal Dhairya, leading community members to anticipate a major update",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "This is not the first extended absence for Kusama - he previously left X in December 2025 for AI work and returned in late January 2026",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Kusama is currently focused on developing R.OS (an AI project) which will operate independently of the Shiba Inu ecosystem",
      "source_url": "https://cryptonews.net/news/altcoins/33042590/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "R.OS is not directly designed to support SHIB, BONE, LEASH, or TREAT tokens, raising concerns about Kusama's priorities",
